# text = What is it but a wilderness of misery and ruin Hah To the eye it is fair enough , here ; but seen in its integrity , under the sky , and by the daylight , it is a crumbling tower of waste , mismanagement , extortion , debt , mortgage , oppression , hunger , nakedness , and suffering Hah If it ever becomes mine , it shall be put into some hands better qualified to free it slowly ( if such a thing is possible ) from the weight that drags it down , so that the miserable people who cannot leave it and who have been long wrung to the last point of endurance , may , in another generation , suffer less ; but it is not for me .
