# text = Pray discuss it with me ; pray enable me to see it a little more clearly , and teach me how to be a little more useful I think it probable that the relapse you have described , my dear friend , was not quite unforeseen by its subject Was it dreaded by him Very much You have no idea how such an apprehension weighs on the sufferer's mind , and how difficult -- how almost impossible -- it is , for him to force himself to utter a word upon the topic that oppresses him Would he be sensibly relieved if he could prevail upon himself to impart that secret brooding to any one , when it is on him I think so .
