# text = I admit that _I_ am a spy , and that it is considered a discreditable station -- though it must be filled by somebody ; but this gentleman is no spy , and why should he so demean himself as to make himself one I play my Ace , Mr . Barsad without any scruple , in a very few minutes I should have hoped , gentlemen both that your respect for my sister I could not better testify my respect for your sister than by finally relieving her of her brother You think not , sir I have thoroughly made up my mind about it And indeed , now I think again , I have a strong impression that I have another good card here , not yet enumerated .
